# Explicit exclusions for local dev: `mint dev` can otherwise try to parse
# Markdown under pnpm’s nested store (e.g. node_modules/.pnpm/.../CHANGELOG.md) as MDX.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/**
**/.pnpm/**
**/.cursor/**
**/.claude/**
**/.github/**
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/CHANGES.md
**/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md
**/SECURITY.md
